## Syntax / EBNF

`try` / `catch` / `throw` grammar lives in compile comments `/*ebnf>>>` … `<<<ebnf*/`. Harvested docs: `src/afw/generated/ebnf/syntax.ebnf` (not a code generator). See **`afw-compiler-ebnf`**.

